                <pb facs="0573" n="459" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg459"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.00/662: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Southgate</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-03-04T12:00:00-07:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 4,
                                1922—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 9:57 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>21. Inauguration of Orellana as President of the Republic took place this
                    morning. His address emphasized the necessity of political peace and hard
                    work.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Southgate</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
